                    <section class="row coaching-section" style="margin-top: 50px">
                            <h3>Why Choose the IELTS Exam?</h3>
                            <p>
                                The IELTS exam is your gateway to global opportunities. Recognized by over 11,000 organizations worldwide, it opens doors to study, work, and live in English-speaking countries. With its fair and reliable testing system, IELTS ensures you’re ready to succeed in real-world English communication.
                            </p>
                           
                            <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/IELTS-1.jpg" alt="Global Recognition" loading="lazy">
									<div class="card-body">
                                            <h5 class="card-title">Global Recognition</h5>
                                            <p class="card-text">The IELTS exam is recognized by universities, employers, and governments across the globe. Whether you’re pursuing higher education, seeking employment, or applying for immigration, IELTS is a trusted certification that opens doors to countless opportunities worldwide.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/IELTS-2.jpg" alt="Real Exam Situation">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h5 class="card-title">Real Exam Situation</h5>
                                            <p class="card-text">The IELTS exam is designed to test practical English skills that you’ll use in real-world situations. From everyday conversations to professional and academic settings, the test ensures you’re prepared to communicate effectively in English-speaking environments.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/IELTS-3.jpg" alt="Flexible Options">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h5 class="card-title">Flexible Options</h5>
                                            <p class="card-text">
                                                IELTS offers two test formats—Academic and General Training—so you can choose the one that aligns with your goals. Whether you’re aiming to study at a university or migrate for work or residency, IELTS provides the flexibility to meet your specific needs.
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/IELTS-4.jpg" alt="Proven Credibility">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h5 class="card-title">Proven Credibility</h5>
                                            <p class="card-text">With millions of test-takers every year, IELTS has established itself as one of the most trusted English proficiency exams. Its rigorous testing standards and global acceptance make it a reliable choice for individuals and institutions alike.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                    </section>
                    <section class="row coaching-section" style="margin-top: 50px">
                        <h3>Why Choose the PTE Exam?</h3>
                        <p>
                            The PTE exam is your fast track to achieving your dreams. Accepted by thousands of institutions and governments globally, it offers a quick, reliable, and flexible way to prove your English proficiency. With its AI-driven scoring system, PTE ensures fairness and accuracy in every test.
                        </p>

                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/PTE-1.jpg" alt="Global Acceptance" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Global Acceptance</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">
                                            The PTE exam is widely recognized by universities, employers, and immigration authorities around the world. Whether you’re applying for higher education, a new job, or permanent residency, PTE is accepted as a trusted measure of English proficiency in numerous countries, making it a versatile choice for global opportunities.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/PTE-2.jpg" alt="Fast Results" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Fast Results</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">The IELTS exam is designed to test practical English skills that you’ll use in real-world situations. From everyday conversations to professional and academic settings, the test ensures you’re prepared to communicate effectively in English-speaking environments.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/PTE-3.jpg" alt="Flexible Testing" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Flexible Testing</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">
                                            The PTE exam offers unmatched flexibility when it comes to scheduling. You can book your test as close as 24 hours in advance, giving you the freedom to plan around your busy schedule. With frequent test dates and locations, it’s easy to find a time that works for you.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/PTE-4.jpg" alt="AI-Powered Scoring" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">AI-Powered Scoring</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">The PTE exam uses advanced AI technology to ensure unbiased and accurate scoring. This eliminates the possibility of human error or bias, providing a fair and reliable assessment of your English skills. You can trust that your results truly reflect your abilities.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                    <section class="row coaching-section" style="margin-top: 50px">
                        <h3>Why Choose the TOEFL Exam?</h3>
                        <p>
                            The TOEFL exam is your trusted partner for academic success. Recognized by over 160 countries, it’s the preferred choice for students aiming to study at top universities. With its focus on academic English, TOEFL prepares you for the challenges of higher education.
                        </p>

                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/TOEFL-1.jpg" alt="Academic Excellence" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Academic Excellence</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text"> The TOEFL exam is specifically designed to assess English proficiency at a university level. It focuses on the type of language skills you’ll need in an academic setting, such as understanding lectures, writing essays, and participating in discussions. This makes it an ideal choice for students aiming to succeed in higher education.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/TOEFL-2.jpg" alt="Global Reach" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Global Reach</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">With acceptance by over 11,500 institutions in more than 160 countries, the TOEFL exam is one of the most widely recognized English proficiency tests in the world. From prestigious universities to government agencies, it’s trusted by organizations globally, making it a reliable option for international students and professionals.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/TOEFL-3.jpg" alt="Comprehensive Testing" loading="lazy" />
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Comprehensive Testing</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">
                                            The TOEFL exam evaluates all four essential language skills—reading, writing, listening, and speaking. This comprehensive approach ensures that test-takers are well-prepared to communicate effectively in real-world academic and professional environments.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/TOEFL-4.jpg" alt="Trusted by Universities" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Trusted by Universities</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">Top universities and institutions prefer the TOEFL exam for its academic rigor and reliability. Its detailed scoring system provides a clear picture of a test-taker’s abilities, giving institutions confidence in their applicants’ readiness for academic success. This trust has made TOEFL a go-to choice for students worldwide.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                    <section class="row coaching-section" style="margin-top: 50px">
                        <h3>Why Choose the Duolingo English Test?</h3>
                        <p>
                            The Duolingo English Test is your modern solution for English proficiency. Affordable, convenient, and accessible from anywhere, it’s perfect for students and professionals on the go. With its quick results and innovative format, Duolingo makes testing stress-free.
                        </p>

                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/DUO-1.jpg" alt="Affordable" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Affordable</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">This is one of the most cost-effective English proficiency exams available. Unlike traditional tests that can be expensive due to testing center fees and additional costs, Duolingo offers a single, low price that includes everything—no hidden fees.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/DUO-2.jpg" alt="Convenient" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Convenient</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">Gone are the days of traveling to a test center and dealing with scheduling hassles. The Duolingo English Test allows you to take the exam entirely online, anytime, and anywhere. All you need is a computer with a webcam, microphone, and a stable internet connection. .</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/DUO-3.jpg" alt="Fast Results" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Flexible Options</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">
                                            Time is often critical when applying to universities or jobs, and the Duolingo English Test delivers results quickly. Within 48 hours of completing the test, you’ll receive your scores, which can be shared instantly with institutions.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="card coaching-card">
                                    <img class="card-img-top" src="~/assets/images/banner/coaching/test-images/DUO-4.jpg" alt="Widely Accepted" loading="lazy">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                        <h5 class="card-title">Widely Accepted</h5>
                                        <p class="card-text">The Duolingo English Test is gaining widespread recognition and is now accepted by thousands of universities, colleges, and organizations worldwide. From top-tier institutions to smaller colleges, many are embracing Duolingo as a valid and reliable measure of English proficiency. This growing acceptance makes it a versatile option for students and professionals aiming to study, work, or migrate internationally.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>
